    "id": "p23-review-q4-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "Draw up a table of values and draw the graph of $y=\\sin 2\\theta$ for $0^\\circ\\leq\\theta\\leq360^\\circ$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Zeros at $\\theta=0^\\circ,90^\\circ,180^\\circ,270^\\circ,360^\\circ$; maxima $y=1$ at $45^\\circ,225^\\circ$; minima $y=-1$ at $135^\\circ,315^\\circ$.\n\nThe graph has amplitude $1$ and period $180^\\circ$. Plot the table values and join them with a smooth sine curve.",
